    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stop intruders and maintain security!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use all your tools to detect enemies, protect buildings, and become the ultimate security guard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;KEEPING NIGHT&quot;</strong> is a fast-paced 2D top-down action-strategy game. Step into the role of a skilled security guard and use weapons, CCTV, and security devices to fend off intruders and safeguard various buildings.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Perfect Blend of Strategy and Action</strong><br>Operate CCTV cameras and security systems in real time to detect and counter enemies. Experience the thrill of combining strategic thinking with fast-paced shooting action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Environments and Enemies</strong><br>Take on unique challenges in various building layouts, each with distinct obstacles and enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unparalleled 2D Top-Down Experience</strong><br>&quot;KEEPING NIGHT&quot; delivers a one-of-a-kind experience, seamlessly blending strategy and action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo Play &amp; Future Co-op Updates</strong><br>Enjoy exciting solo missions, and look forward to cooperative mode updates in the future.</p></li></ul>",
